WEBVTT

00:00.940 --> 00:01.820
Mark 2

00:01.820 --> 00:06.160
And when he returned to Capernaum after some days,

00:06.380 --> 00:08.200
it was reported that he was at home,

00:08.680 --> 00:10.220
and many were gathered together,

00:10.400 --> 00:13.080
so that there was no more room, not even at the door.

00:13.560 --> 00:15.380
And he was preaching the word to them.

00:16.360 --> 00:19.980
And they came, bringing to him a paralytic carried by four men.

00:20.520 --> 00:22.940
And when they could not get near him because of the crowd,

00:23.280 --> 00:24.840
they removed the roof above him.

00:25.180 --> 00:26.680
And when they had made an opening,

00:26.680 --> 00:29.760
they let down the bed on which the paralytic lay.

00:30.440 --> 00:33.360
And when Jesus saw their faith, he said to the paralytic,

00:34.200 --> 00:36.720
Son, your sins are forgiven.

00:37.560 --> 00:39.660
Now some of the scribes were sitting there,

00:39.860 --> 00:41.520
questioning in their hearts,

00:42.600 --> 00:44.460
Why does this man speak like that?

00:44.600 --> 00:46.020
He's blaspheming!

00:46.420 --> 00:49.080
Who can forgive sins but God alone?

00:49.960 --> 00:52.760
And immediately Jesus, perceiving in his spirit

00:52.760 --> 00:54.920
that they thus questioned within themselves,

00:55.060 --> 00:56.120
said to them,

00:57.100 --> 00:59.400
Why do you question these things in your hearts?

01:00.020 --> 01:02.580
Which is easier, to say to the paralytic,

01:03.000 --> 01:03.920
Your sins are forgiven,

01:04.360 --> 01:05.400
or to say,

01:05.860 --> 01:07.900
Rise, take up your bed and walk,

01:08.460 --> 01:10.860
but that you may know that the Son of Man

01:10.860 --> 01:13.240
has authority on earth to forgive sins?

01:14.200 --> 01:15.540
He said to the paralytic,

01:16.320 --> 01:17.260
I say to you,

01:17.620 --> 01:20.620
Rise, pick up your bed, and go home.

01:21.200 --> 01:23.880
And he rose and immediately picked up his bed

01:23.880 --> 01:25.600
and went out before them all,

01:25.600 --> 01:28.680
so that they were all amazed and glorified God, saying,

01:28.680 --> 01:31.540
We never saw anything like this.

01:33.400 --> 01:35.420
He went out again beside the sea,

01:35.540 --> 01:37.340
and all the crowd was coming to him,

01:37.600 --> 01:38.680
and he was teaching them.

01:39.380 --> 01:40.640
And as he passed by,

01:40.820 --> 01:42.640
he saw Levi, the son of Alphaeus,

01:42.760 --> 01:43.860
sitting at the tax booth,

01:44.180 --> 01:44.980
and he said to him,

01:45.380 --> 01:46.400
Follow me.

01:46.960 --> 01:48.820
And he rose and followed him.

01:50.020 --> 01:52.780
And as he reclined at table in his house,

01:52.780 --> 01:54.940
many tax collectors and sinners

01:54.940 --> 01:57.460
were reclining with Jesus and his disciples,

01:58.060 --> 01:58.660
for there were many,

01:58.660 --> 01:59.540
many who followed him.

02:00.080 --> 02:01.960
And the scribes of the Pharisees,

02:02.120 --> 02:04.000
when they saw that he was eating with sinners

02:04.000 --> 02:05.020
and tax collectors,

02:05.420 --> 02:06.680
said to his disciples,

02:07.040 --> 02:10.200
Why does he eat with tax collectors and sinners?

02:10.920 --> 02:12.540
And when Jesus heard it,

02:12.660 --> 02:13.600
he said to them,

02:14.320 --> 02:17.100
Those who are well have no need of a physician,

02:17.560 --> 02:18.700
but those who are sick.

02:18.960 --> 02:20.440
I came not to call the righteous,

02:21.000 --> 02:21.700
but sinners.

02:22.340 --> 02:25.720
Now John's disciples and the Pharisees were fasting,

02:25.720 --> 02:27.840
and people came and said to him,

02:28.660 --> 02:30.040
Why do John's disciples

02:30.040 --> 02:32.480
and the disciples of the Pharisees fast,

02:32.860 --> 02:34.940
but your disciples do not fast?

02:35.620 --> 02:37.240
And Jesus said to them,

02:37.900 --> 02:39.480
Can the wedding guests fast

02:39.480 --> 02:40.960
while the bridegroom is with them?

02:42.060 --> 02:43.960
As long as they have the bridegroom with them,

02:44.220 --> 02:45.320
they cannot fast.

02:45.920 --> 02:47.120
The days will come

02:47.120 --> 02:49.020
when the bridegroom is taken away from them,

02:49.440 --> 02:51.740
and then they will fast in that day.

02:53.000 --> 02:55.020
No one sews a piece of unshrunk cloth

02:55.020 --> 02:55.840
on an old garment.

02:56.380 --> 02:57.120
If he does,

02:57.120 --> 02:58.540
the patch tears away

02:58.540 --> 02:58.920
from it,

02:59.340 --> 03:00.460
the new from the old,

03:00.820 --> 03:02.160
and a worse tear is made.

03:02.620 --> 03:04.040
And no one puts new wine

03:04.040 --> 03:05.120
into old wineskins.

03:05.440 --> 03:06.240
If he does,

03:06.580 --> 03:08.040
the wine will burst the skins,

03:08.300 --> 03:09.600
and the wine is destroyed.

03:10.120 --> 03:11.280
And so are the skins.

03:12.320 --> 03:14.540
But new wine is for fresh wineskins.

03:16.640 --> 03:19.240
One Sabbath he was going through the grain fields,

03:19.560 --> 03:21.060
and as they made their way,

03:21.240 --> 03:23.560
his disciples began to pluck heads of grain.

03:24.080 --> 03:26.440
And the Pharisees were saying to him,

03:27.200 --> 03:27.620
Look,

03:27.620 --> 03:29.680
why are they doing

03:29.680 --> 03:31.840
what is not lawful on the Sabbath?

03:32.740 --> 03:33.780
And he said to them,

03:34.580 --> 03:36.100
Have you never read what David did

03:36.100 --> 03:37.640
when he was in need and was hungry,

03:38.000 --> 03:39.240
he and those who were with him?

03:39.760 --> 03:41.420
How he entered the house of God

03:41.420 --> 03:43.400
in the time of Abiathar the high priest,

03:43.800 --> 03:45.640
and ate the bread of the presence,

03:46.000 --> 03:47.620
which it is not lawful for any

03:47.620 --> 03:48.760
but the priest to eat,

03:49.140 --> 03:51.480
and also gave it to those who were with him?

03:52.040 --> 03:53.360
And he said to them,

03:54.100 --> 03:55.820
The Sabbath was made for man,

03:55.820 --> 03:57.240
not man for the Sabbath,

03:57.620 --> 03:59.180
so the Son of Man is Lord,

03:59.320 --> 04:00.320
even of the Sabbath.

